---
import FaviconLinks from '../../components/FaviconLinks.astro';
import '../../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<FaviconLinks />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
		<title>Terms &amp; Conditions — Buzbo</title>
	</head>
	<body class="font-sans antialiased text-gray-900">
		<main class="mx-auto max-w-xl px-5 py-8 sm:px-6 sm:py-10">
			<p class="mb-6 rounded-md border border-primary-mauve/30 bg-primary-mauve/10 px-3 py-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-primary-mauve">
				Pending review by NL/EU legal counsel before public launch.
			</p>

			<h1 class="text-3xl leading-tight text-primary-crimson sm:text-4xl">Buzbo Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
			<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Last updated: 26 August 2026</p>
			<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
				Operated by AH Limited B.V., registered in the Netherlands, KVK 92705987.
				Contact: <a href="mailto:hello@buzbo.com" class="font-medium text-primary-crimson underline underline-offset-2">hello@buzbo.com</a>.
			</p>

			<article class="legal mt-8 space-y-8 text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-800">
					<p class="mt-3">Welcome to Buzbo — a professional connection platform designed to help professionals and business managers discover relevant people and start genuine professional conversations. These Terms govern your use of the Buzbo app, buzbo.com, and related services.</p>
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl leading-snug text-primary-crimson">1. Who we are</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">Buzbo is currently operated by <strong>AH Limited B.V.</strong>, registered in the Netherlands under KVK number <strong>92705987</strong>.</p>
					<p class="mt-3">Email: <a href="mailto:hello@buzbo.com" class="font-medium text-primary-crimson underline underline-offset-2">hello@buzbo.com</a></p>
					<p class="mt-3"><em>Buzbo B.V. is intended to be established as a separate company. These Terms will be updated if and when responsibility for the Buzbo service transfers to that entity.</em></p>
				</section>
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl leading-snug text-primary-crimson">2. Eligibility</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">You must be at least <strong>18 years old</strong> to use Buzbo. By creating an account, you confirm you meet this requirement and that all information you provide is accurate.</p>
				</section>
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl leading-snug text-primary-crimson">3. What Buzbo is</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">Buzbo helps professionals and business managers discover and connect with people based on professional information, skills, preferences, ambitions, and work style. <strong>Buzbo is not a recruitment agency, employer, employment agency, or party to any employment, freelance, or other agreement between users.</strong> Any relationship formed through Buzbo is between the users involved, not with Buzbo.</p>
				</section>
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl leading-snug text-primary-crimson">4. Your account</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">You're responsible for keeping your account secure, providing accurate information, keeping it reasonably up to date, and all activity under your account. One personal account per person, unless we explicitly permit otherwise. You must not impersonate someone else, use another person's LinkedIn profile without authorization, or provide misleading professional information.</p>
				</section>
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl leading-snug text-primary-crimson">5. Your Buzbo profile</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">You can create a profile with information such as your name, age, photo, professional background, skills, languages, ambitions, and work preferences. Buzbo may use AI to help structure this into your profile — you're responsible for reviewing what's generated before it's shown to anyone. You retain ownership of the content you provide, subject to the license in Section 15.</p>
				</section>
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl leading-snug text-primary-crimson">6. LinkedIn</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">Connecting LinkedIn is optional. You must only provide the URL of <strong>your own</strong> LinkedIn profile, or one you're legally authorized to provide. By doing so, you authorize Buzbo to retrieve relevant professional information from it to create your Buzbo profile — as a draft you then review and approve, not something published automatically. You're responsible for making sure the information you provide can lawfully be shared with Buzbo.</p>
				</section>
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl leading-snug text-primary-crimson">7. Company information provided by Business Managers</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">Connecting your company's LinkedIn is optional, using the same flow as Section 6: you provide the URL of your own LinkedIn Company profile, explicitly authorize Buzbo to retrieve information from it, and review, edit, and approve the resulting draft before it's used or shown to anyone else.</p>
					<p class="mt-3">Depending on what's available, this may include the company name and description, recent publicly available company posts, and publicly visible information about people associated with the company. This information is used only to help build your own Buzbo profile — never to create a profile of anyone else — and you're never obligated to use this feature.</p>
					<p class="mt-3"><strong>You are responsible for ensuring that the company information you approve is accurate and does not unlawfully infringe the rights of others.</strong></p>
				</section>
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl leading-snug text-primary-crimson">8. AI and recommendations</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">Buzbo uses AI to help create profiles — yours, and, if you're a business manager, your company's context — from information you or Buzbo retrieve as described in Sections 6 and 7. AI-generated content may be inaccurate — review it before approving.</p>
					<p class="mt-3">Separately, Buzbo uses a scoring system, not AI, to generate recommendations of people who may be relevant to you, based on your profile and preferences. <strong>Buzbo does not make hiring decisions on your behalf</strong>, and a recommendation is not a guarantee of employment, an interview, a freelance engagement, a business relationship, or any other outcome.</p>
				</section>
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl leading-snug text-primary-crimson">9. Connections and messaging</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">Buzbo allows users to indicate interest in connecting with other users. Where both users connect, messaging functionality may become available. You are responsible for your communications with other users. You must not use Buzbo to harass, threaten, discriminate against, defraud, spam, or otherwise harm another user.</p>
					<p class="mt-3">Conduct rules, reporting, and blocking are set out in full in our <strong>Community &amp; Safety Guidelines</strong>, which form part of these Terms. We may remove content, remove a match, restrict messaging, suspend, or terminate an account where we reasonably believe these Terms, our Community &amp; Safety Guidelines, or applicable law has been violated, or where necessary to protect users or Buzbo.</p>
				</section>
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl leading-snug text-primary-crimson">10. Events</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">If you attend a Buzbo event, our <strong>Event Terms</strong> apply in addition to these Terms.</p>
				</section>
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl leading-snug text-primary-crimson">11. Subscriptions</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">Buzbo offers a free tier and paid tiers, processed through Apple's App Store or Google Play billing systems via RevenueCat — <strong>Buzbo does not process or store your card details.</strong></p>
					<p class="mt-3"><strong>Current plans:</strong></p>
					<ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
						<li><strong>Plus</strong> — €28.99/month</li>
						<li><strong>Premium</strong> — €38.99/month</li>
						<li><strong>Skip the Wait</strong> — €7.99 one-time purchase, unlocks the next five profiles directly. This is not a subscription.</li>
					</ul>
					<p class="mt-3">Features included in each plan are shown in the app before purchase. We won't remove the essential value of a paid subscription without appropriate notice.</p>
					<p class="mt-3">Where an auto-renewing subscription is offered:</p>
					<ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
						<li>Payment is charged to your Apple ID or Google Play account at confirmation of purchase.</li>
						<li><strong>The subscription automatically renews unless auto-renewal is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.</strong></li>
						<li>Your account is charged for renewal within 24 hours before the end of the current period, at the price of the plan you selected.</li>
						<li>You can manage or cancel your subscription anytime in your Apple ID or Google Play account settings — Buzbo cannot cancel it on your behalf.</li>
						<li>If a free trial is offered, any unused portion is forfeited once you purchase a subscription during the trial.</li>
						<li>Prices may change; we'll give notice before any change takes effect for existing subscribers, consistent with Apple's and Google's policies.</li>
					</ul>
				</section>
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl leading-snug text-primary-crimson">12. Free tier</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">Buzbo offers a free tier, which may include limits on daily profile browsing, weekly connections, available filters, and other functionality. Current limits are shown in the app.</p>
				</section>
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl leading-snug text-primary-crimson">13. Intellectual property</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">Buzbo's name, logo, design, software, and other Buzbo-owned materials belong to Buzbo or its licensors. You must not copy, reproduce, modify, distribute, reverse-engineer, scrape, or commercially exploit Buzbo without our permission, except where mandatory law permits it.</p>
				</section>
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl leading-snug text-primary-crimson">14. Prohibited activities</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">In addition to the rules in our Community &amp; Safety Guidelines, you must not: create false or misleading profiles; scrape or extract Buzbo data; use automated systems to access Buzbo without permission; attempt to bypass security controls; interfere with Buzbo's operation; distribute malware; or use Buzbo to promote unrelated products or services without authorization.</p>
				</section>
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl leading-snug text-primary-crimson">15. Content you submit</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">You retain ownership of content you submit to Buzbo. You grant Buzbo a non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free license to host, store, process, and display that content as reasonably necessary to operate and improve Buzbo. This license ends when the content is deleted, except where continued retention is necessary for legal, security, or technical reasons.</p>
				</section>
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl leading-snug text-primary-crimson">16. Account deletion and termination</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">You can stop using Buzbo and request deletion of your account at any time by emailing <a href="mailto:hello@buzbo.com" class="font-medium text-primary-crimson underline underline-offset-2">hello@buzbo.com</a>. We may suspend or terminate an account where reasonably necessary to enforce these Terms, protect users, prevent fraud or abuse, comply with law, or protect our systems.</p>
				</section>
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl leading-snug text-primary-crimson">17. Disclaimer</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">Buzbo is provided "as available." We don't guarantee that every profile or recommendation is accurate, that another user is who they claim to be, that a connection will lead to any professional outcome, or that AI-generated information will always be correct. You're responsible for evaluating people you meet through Buzbo.</p>
				</section>
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl leading-snug text-primary-crimson">18. Limitation of liability</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">To the maximum extent permitted by Dutch and EU law, Buzbo is not liable for indirect or consequential losses arising from your use of the platform or interactions with other users. Nothing here excludes or limits liability that cannot legally be excluded or limited, including for intent or gross negligence.</p>
				</section>
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl leading-snug text-primary-crimson">19. Changes</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">We may update Buzbo, or these Terms, as the service develops. Where a change materially affects paid services or your legal rights, we'll give appropriate notice.</p>
				</section>
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl leading-snug text-primary-crimson">20. Governing law</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">These Terms are governed by the laws of the Netherlands, without prejudice to mandatory consumer-protection rights you have under the law of your own country of residence if you're an EU consumer. Disputes are submitted to the competent court in the Netherlands.</p>
				</section>
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl leading-snug text-primary-crimson">21. Contact</h2>
					<p class="mt-3"><strong>AH Limited B.V. — Buzbo</strong></p>
					<p class="mt-3">KVK: 92705987</p>
					<p class="mt-3">Email: <a href="mailto:hello@buzbo.com" class="font-medium text-primary-crimson underline underline-offset-2">hello@buzbo.com</a></p>
				</section>

				<p class="border-t border-primary-mauve/20 pt-6 text-sm text-gray-600">
